The `zmachine/` subdirectory is a vendored copy of the ravdin/zmachine
Z-machine interpreter, redistributed here under its original MIT license.

Source:  https://github.com/ravdin/zmachine
Commit:  867223f865c21f3f762966b32787bd0c5d5d413a

Modifications made for vendoring:
  - Omitted modules that pull in non-stdlib dependencies or an interactive
    terminal, none of which are used by this package's headless driver:
      * curses.py   (requires the `curses` terminal library)
      * graphics.py (requires `pygame` / `numpy`)
      * builder.py  (hard-wires the curses/graphics terminal adapters)
      * __main__.py (the interactive CLI entry point)
  - No source files were otherwise modified; the headless driver lives in
    aprsd_lurkinghorror_plugin/engine.py and supplies its own I/O adapters.

